  230           FFFA        .org $FFFA     ;first of the three vectors starts here
  231  07:FFFA  2F DA       .dw NMI        ;when an NMI happens (once per frame if enabled) the 
  232                                        ;processor will jump to the label NMI:
  233  07:FFFC  00 C0       .dw RESET      ;when the processor first turns on or is reset, it will jump
  234                                        ;to the label RESET:
  235  07:FFFE  00 00       .dw 0          ;external interrupt IRQ is not used in this tutorial
